{%- comment -%}
  Sold out / cancelled stamp. Params: sold_out, cancelled (booleans)

  Reserved for information also stated in text nearby, so the small tag size
  never carries the meaning alone.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% if cancelled %}
  <span class="tag tag-ghost">Cancelled</span>
{% elsif sold_out %}
  <span class="tag">Sold out</span>
{% endif %}
